 your heart out---because the ULTIMATE MAMMA MIA!-fueled brunch experience 
 
is HERE! 🌟 WHAT TO EXPECT: 🎶 LIVE\, show-stopping performances inspir
 
ed by MAMMA MIA! on Broadway from our World-Famous Singing Waitstaff! 🥂 
 
Two hours of pure brunch bliss\, featuring your choice of delicious entrée
 
 & bottomless mimosas (if you dare)! 💃 Legendary Starduster performances
 
 that will have you singing "Gimme! Gimme! Gimme!" before dessert! 🎟 TIC
 
KET OPTIONS: ✨ Regular Ticket - $50 (Entry + entrée + soda/juice/tea/cof
 
fee) 🥂 Bottomless Ticket - $75 (Everything above + unlimited mimosas for
 
 up to two hours!) 🍸 Full cash bar available for all other cocktails! 
 
 DRESS CODE: Channel your inner Dynamo---think sequins\, flares\, and all
 
 things groovy! The more fabulous\, the better! 📍 Brunch takes place in 
 
The Stardust Theater\, below Ellen's Stardust Diner. All guests must have p
 
re-purchased tickets. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/mamma
 
-mia-bottomless-brunch-at-ellens-stardust-theater-tickets/14321584
